{
  "name": "Adv 3 - Agentic Loop 迭代診斷 [手刻 ReAct：AI 自主決定查什麼、查幾次]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Adv 3：Agentic Loop（ReAct Pattern）\n\n**跟 Demo 7 Tool Calling 的差別**：\n- Demo 7：AI 一次決定呼叫哪些工具，呼叫完就回答\n- Adv 3：AI 呼叫工具 → **看結果** → 判斷資訊夠不夠 → 不夠再查 → 夠了才回答\n\n**這就是 AI Agent 節點的內部原理**——這裡手刻出來，\n學員看懂之後再回頭看 AI Agent 節點就不是黑盒子了。\n\n**循環結構**：組 Prompt → Gemini 決策 → 執行工具 → 更新 Scratchpad → 回到組 Prompt\n**安全閥**：最多 5 次迭代，防止無限循環燒 token。",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "adv3-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-64, -128]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "adv3-manual",
      "name": "Demo Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-16, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: {\n  question: 'prod-node-03 現在狀況怎麼樣？需要處理嗎？',\n  scratchpad: '',\n  iteration: 0\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "adv3-init",
      "name": "初始化",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [208, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Loop 入口：每次迭代都重組 prompt，帶上已蒐集的觀察結果\nconst { question, scratchpad, iteration } = $json;\nconst prompt = [\n  '你是 IT 維運診斷助理。回答問題前，你可以呼叫工具蒐集資訊。',\n  '',\n  '可用工具：',\n  '- get_device_status(host)：查詢設備即時狀態（CPU/Memory/Disk）',\n  '- get_recent_alerts()：查詢過去 24 小時告警歷史',\n  '',\n  '規則：每次只回傳一個 JSON（不要 markdown 包裹）：',\n  '需要更多資訊 → {\"action\": \"tool_call\", \"tool\": \"工具名\", \"args\": {\"host\": \"...\"}, \"thought\": \"為什麼要查\"}',\n  '資訊足夠了 → {\"action\": \"final_answer\", \"answer\": \"你的完整回答\"}',\n  '',\n  '問題：' + question,\n  scratchpad ? '\\n目前已蒐集的資訊：' + scratchpad : ''\n].join('\\n');\nreturn [{ json: { question, scratchpad, iteration, prompt } }];"
      },
      "id": "adv3-prompt",
      "name": "組 ReAct Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [432, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent?key=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { contents: [ { parts: [ { text: $json.prompt } ] } ], generationConfig: { temperature: 0.1 } } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv3-gemini",
      "name": "Gemini: 決策",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [656, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const state = $('組 ReAct Prompt').item.json;\nconst text = $json.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || '{}';\nconst clean = text.replace(/```json\\n?|```/g, '').trim();\nlet decision = {};\ntry { decision = JSON.parse(clean); }\ncatch (e) { decision = { action: 'final_answer', answer: 'AI 回應解析失敗：' + text }; }\nreturn [{ json: {\n  question: state.question,\n  scratchpad: state.scratchpad,\n  iteration: state.iteration,\n  action: decision.action || 'final_answer',\n  tool: decision.tool || null,\n  args: decision.args || {},\n  thought: decision.thought || null,\n  answer: decision.answer || null\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "adv3-parse",
      "name": "解析決策",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [880, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "fa1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}",
              "rightValue": "final_answer",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv3-if-final",
      "name": "IF: 資訊足夠了？",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1104, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: {\n  status: 'answered',\n  question: $json.question,\n  answer: $json.answer,\n  iterations_used: $json.iteration\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "adv3-answer",
      "name": "輸出最終答案",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1328, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 1
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "sw1",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tool }}",
                    "rightValue": "get_device_status",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "device_status"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 1
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "sw2",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tool }}",
                    "rightValue": "get_recent_alerts",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "recent_alerts"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv3-switch",
      "name": "Switch: 執行哪個工具",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1328, 448]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=http://host.containers.internal:3001/api/devices/{{ $json.args.host || 'prod-node-03' }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv3-tool-dev",
      "name": "工具: 查設備狀態",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1552, 384]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://host.containers.internal:3001/api/alerts/history",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "hours",
              "value": "24"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv3-tool-alerts",
      "name": "工具: 查告警歷史",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1552, 544]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 把工具結果寫回 Scratchpad，迭代次數 +1，回到 Loop 入口\nconst decision = $('解析決策').item.json;\nconst observation = JSON.stringify($json);\nconst entry = '\\nThought: ' + (decision.thought || '') +\n  '\\nAction: ' + decision.tool + '(' + JSON.stringify(decision.args) + ')' +\n  '\\nObservation: ' + observation;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  question: decision.question,\n  scratchpad: decision.scratchpad + entry,\n  iteration: decision.iteration + 1\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "adv3-scratchpad",
      "name": "更新 Scratchpad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1776, 448]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "lim1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.iteration }}",
              "rightValue": 5,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv3-if-limit",
      "name": "IF: 未達迭代上限？",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2000, 448]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: {\n  status: 'max_iterations_reached',\n  question: $json.question,\n  answer: '已達 5 次迭代上限仍未取得足夠資訊，請人工介入。已蒐集：' + $json.scratchpad,\n  iterations_used: $json.iteration\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "adv3-limit-out",
      "name": "輸出：迭代超限",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2224, 544]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:5678/webhook/notify-hub",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { source: 'adv3-agentic-loop', severity: 'critical', title: 'AI 診斷迭代超限，需人工介入', message: '問題：' + $json.question + '\\n已迭代 ' + $json.iterations_used + ' 次仍無法取得足夠資訊。' } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv3-notify",
      "name": "推送通知",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2448, 544]
    }
  ],
